ok: a command this scan cannot place is reported, not ignored
ok: dynamic-run executes a program as much as run does
ok: an action head on neither list is reported
ok: a program action's arguments are not actions
ok: an executable elsewhere keeps its path
ok: a filename's punctuation is part of its identity
ok: a toolchain pform runs a compiler, not a test
ok: a path built out of a pform is not guessed at
